<urn:atm:triage:finding/BB6-025>
  a triage:Finding ;
  triage:findingId "BB6-025" ;
  triage:title "prompt_handoffs UNIQUE(team,agent,message_key,attempt) collides task_queued and task_ready for one assignment, silently dropping task_ready" ;
  triage:description "fenix (2026-09-13T02:02:27Z), observed by solar at fix/bb6-docs-qa1 @ 9429a9971 in a fresh arm64 colima image (sha256:f9a96560...). The prompt_handoffs UNIQUE (team, agent, message_key, attempt) constraint collides task_queued and task_ready for one assignment (same message_key, both attempt 0), so record_prompt_handoff's INSERT OR IGNORE silently drops the task_ready row. `atm task events` shows handoffs [task_queued, task_reminder, task_started] with task_ready absent, while the pane shows all three blocks; violates sprint-BB.6 lines 184/189. Contributing: unit test task_pass_records_handoff_with_kind_and_attempt never seeds the preceding task_queued row, so the collision is untested." ;
  triage:phaseId "phase-bb" ;
  triage:triageMode "initial_pass" ;
  triage:category "correctness" ;
  triage:severity "blocking" ;
  triage:source "fenix, observed by solar at fix/bb6-docs-qa1 in a fresh arm64 colima image" ;
  triage:repeatable true ;
  triage:sweepScope "crates/atm-storage-rusqlite/src/task_sql.rs (DDL); crates/atm-http-runtime/src/prompt_handoff_record.rs (record_prompt_handoff, test task_pass_records_handoff_with_kind_and_attempt)" ;
  triage:status "fixed" ;
  triage:dispatchReady true ;
  triage:triagedAt "2026-09-13T02:02:27Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
  triage:deferredNote "Root cause: prompt_handoffs UNIQUE (team, agent, message_key, attempt) does not distinguish handoff kind, so task_queued and task_ready for the same assignment (same message_key, attempt 0) collide and record_prompt_handoff's INSERT OR IGNORE silently drops the second (task_ready) row. Evidence: site/reports/bb6-prompt-handoffs/20260913T015759104883Z (uncommitted, on solar's host). Fenix's ruling (2026-09-13T02:04:09Z): handoff identity becomes (team, agent, message_key, kind, attempt); UNIQUE gains the kind column. An unreleased table carrying the legacy shape on dev hosts is detected via sqlite_master and dropped+recreated at open (no migration machinery exists yet; ADR-061 D1 has no schema version). Sprint D1 DDL and the ADR-061 BB.6 entry are amended in the same layer, and task_pass_records_handoff_with_kind_and_attempt is fixed to seed the preceding task_queued row so the collision is covered. Dispatched as BB6-FIX-HANDOFF-IDENTITY-1789286000 to arch-ctm at the head of his queue, branch fix/bb6-handoff-identity cut from fix/bb6-cli-qa2 @ f0758be06 (stack position: above cli-qa2, below fix/bb-flaky-reader-pool; docs-qa1 lands on top). First push by arch-ctm (2026-09-13T02:14:48Z) at fix/bb6-handoff-identity @ 113d9021b: focused storage/runtime tests, clippy, RULE-002/003, and boundaries green; negative mutation proof confirmed. Developer work complete (2026-09-13T02:38:40Z), frozen final head c86eca234; implementation commit 113d9021b; lint 36/36, just test/workspace tests green. Fixed-pending-QA at c86eca234." ;
  triage:foundIn triage:BB6 ;
  triage:foundAt "2026-09-13T02:02:27Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
  triage:hasOccurrence <urn:atm:triage:occurrence/BB6-025/1> ;
  triage:hasOccurrence <urn:atm:triage:occurrence/BB6-025/2> ;
  triage:hasOccurrence <urn:atm:triage:occurrence/BB6-025/3> ;
  triage:hasResolution <urn:atm:triage:resolution/BB6-025/1> ;
  triage:closedAt "2026-09-13T03:04:08Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
  triage:closedBy "quality-mgr" ;
  triage:triageRecordVersion "5" .

