  triage:resolutionNote "quality-mgr BB-LANDING-QA-1789301000 batch 1/3 (2026-09-13T03:04:08Z), verified against unified head fix/bb6-docs-qa1 @ 0b9b3e4f3. crates/atm-storage-rusqlite/src/task_store.rs:55-65 UNIQUE constraint now includes the kind column, matching fenix's ruling exactly, plus drop_legacy_prompt_handoffs (line 103, sqlite_master-detected legacy-table drop+recreate); crates/atm-http-runtime/src/herdr_queue_wake/tests/mod.rs:1422 task_pass_records_handoff_with_kind_and_attempt now seeds the preceding task_queued row and asserts both rows distinctly." .
